  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that \\(|\\sin x|\\) is a periodic function of \\(\\pi\\)\n\\(\\text { Hence } \\begin{array}{r}\n\\int_0^{4 \\pi}|\\sin x| d x=4 \\int_0^\\pi|\\sin x| d x=4 \\int_0^\\pi \\sin x d x \\\\\n=4[-\\cos x]_0^\\pi=8\n\\end{array}\\)",
